msgid "This module converts from :ref:`Equatorial coordinates <ai-skycoords-equatorial>` to :ref:`Galactic coordinates <ai-skycoords-galactic>`, and vice versa. Fill in the coordinate values in either the ``Galactic coordinates`` or ``Equatorial coordinates (J2000)`` section. Alternatively set the equatorial coordinates by selecting an object using the ``Find Object`` dialog. Then the complementary coordinates will be filled in."
