#. +> trunk5
#: ../../user_manual/tool-calculator.rst:150
#, fuzzy
msgid "The module contains a batch mode for converting several coordinate pairs at once. You must construct an input file in which each line contains two values: the input coordinate pairs (either Equatorial or Galactic). Then specify which coordinates you are using as input, and identify the input and output filenames. Finally, press the ``Run`` button to generate the output file, which will contain the converted coordinates (Equatorial or Galactic; the complement of what you chose as the input values)."
